WEBVTT

00:13:58.107 --> 00:14:00.847
But during that time,
there were many white people

00:14:00.847 --> 00:14:04.214
that didn't think that
racial discrimination was okay,

00:14:04.214 --> 00:14:06.373
but they stayed quiet,

00:14:06.373 --> 00:14:11.507
because they enjoyed the privileges
of better jobs,

00:14:11.507 --> 00:14:14.918
unique access to jury duty,

00:14:14.918 --> 00:14:17.169
better schools, and everything else,

00:14:17.169 --> 00:14:19.330
and that's the same thing
that exists today,

00:14:19.330 --> 00:14:22.975
because the average man
really doesn't care.

00:14:22.975 --> 00:14:29.320
Even though they say, "I'm against
discrimination against girls and women,"

00:14:29.320 --> 00:14:32.770
they enjoy a privileged position.